  ✓ Rebuild definitions and rerun every positive K proof claim
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy and real-program pinning
  ✓ Inventory and review every K declaration and rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful non-vacuity mutation
  ✓ Account for assumptions, write evidence, and finalize REVIEW.md
